001	GEN	035	013	Ilaahna kor buu uga tegey isagii iyo meeshii uu kula hadlayba.
001	GEN	035	014	Yacquubna meeshii uu kula hadlay isaga wuxuu ka taagay tiir, kaas oo ahaa tiir dhagax ah; wuxuuna ku dul shubay qurbaan cabniin ah, saliidna wuu ku dul shubay.
001	GEN	035	015	Yacquubna meeshii Ilaah kula hadlay isaga magaceedii wuxuu u bixiyey Beytel.
