009	1SA	019	004	Oo Yoonaataanna wax wanaagsan ayuu aabbihiis Saa'uul uga sheegay Daa'uud, oo ku yidhi, Addoonkaaga Daa'uud ha ku dembaabin, maxaa yeelay, isagu kuguma uu dembaabin, oo shuqulladiisuna xaggaaga aad bay ugu wanaagsanaayeen,
