041	MAR	016	009	(note: The most reliable and earliest manuscripts do not include Mark 16:9-20.) Waaberigii maalintii ugu horraysay ee toddobaadka ayaa Ciise sara kacay, oo markii hore wuxuu u muuqday Maryan tii reer Magdala, tii uu toddoba jinni ka saaray.
