058	HEB	002	011	Waayo, kan quduus ka dhiga iyo kuwa quduus laga dhigaaba kulli mid keliya ayay ka yimaadaan; taas aawadeed isagu kalama xishoodo inuu iyaga ugu yeedho walaalo,
