058	HEB	004	003	Waayo, kuweenna rumaystay, nasashadaas waynu galnaa, siduu u yidhi, Sidaas daraaddeed anigoo cadhaysan ayaan waxaan ku dhaartay, Iyagu nasashadayda ma geli doonaan, in kastoo ay shuqulladii ka dhammaadeen aasaaska dunida.
